  "slug": "liability-incident-policy-change-request-form",
  "title": "Liability Incident Policy Change Request Form",
  "subtitle": "A decision-ready liability incident policy change request that preserves identity, facts, evidence, authorization, exceptions, and accountable handoff without replacing the controlling policy or qualified judgment.",
  "description": "An original liability incident policy change request for reported third-party incident and premises or activity with domain-specific intake, investigation, evidence, decision, escalation, audit, and closeout controls.",
  "use_case": "Use when the liability claim intake and investigation owner must open and control a policy change request for reported third-party incident and premises or activity. The record closes only after evidence and limitations are visible, authorized decisions are distinguishable from pending review, exceptions have owners, and the next recipient accepts the handoff.",
  "risk_tier": "B",
